<title>BOTSWANA: Botswana yr/yr inflation drops to 9.3 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Botswana yr/yr inflation drops to 9.3 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Botswana's all-items consumer price index rose by one percent in March from February, bringing the year-on-year increase to 9.3 percent, down from 9.4 percent in February, the Central Statistics Office said.</p>
<p>				March 1997	 Feb 1997	Mar 1996</p>
<p>    Yr/Yr pct change    9.3		  9.4	     10.2</p>
<p>    All-items index     103.2		102.2	   94.4</p>
<p>Note - Index November 1996 = 100</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267 347182</p>
</text>
